			<TRAN name="obtro_oder_234r" title="해외주식 주문가능금액 최대주문" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="480" _ulen="346" >

ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
ASNO^계좌일련번호^2^0^0^0^0^0^0
OVRS_STCK_SYMB_ISCD^해외주식심볼종목코드^12^0^0^0^0^0^0
OVRS_EXCH_VNDR_IDNO^해외거래소벤더식별번호^6^0^0^0^0^0^0
OVRS_MRKT_BROK_IDNO^해외시장브로커식별번호^6^0^0^0^0^0^0
ODER_CRNC_PRC^주문통화가격^20^8^7^0^0^0^0
APLY_RATE^적용비율^9^4^7^0^0^0^0
ACNT_PWD^계좌비밀번호^68^0^0^0^0^0^0
IF_INTG_MARG_IQRY_YN^IF통합증거금조회여부^1^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" inout="out" _len="100" _ulen="76" >

LIMT_CAMT^한도통화금액^20^4^7^0^0^0^0
ODER_ABLE_QTY^주문가능수량^19^0^7^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
			</TRAN>
		</TRIO_INFO>
	</DATAIO_INFO>
